Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想 再多了解一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡一個人的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:29.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抽啊抽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抽啊抽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個早晨好奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有種把東西忘在夢裡了的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天來谷請假?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她請假了?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又去哪翹課了而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:55.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是沒可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.01,0:03:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論發生什麼 你都要保護好鈴君
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保護鈴?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保護鈴…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去 去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝…謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎 杉並同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很…很奇怪吧 我總這樣偷看你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會不自覺地追著你看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可卻總是在意旁人眼光 想說卻開不了口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣…是不行的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:25.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我知道直枝君已經有心上人了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.97,0:04:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當我沒說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這…莫非是被告白了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…我的心上人說的是誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會想到鈴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會的!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會不會不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是因為總混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像理所當然似的總在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在慌什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是被告白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 理樹 被告白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介 你什麼時候出現的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也這麼說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上個月鈴也被高三的學長告白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方表示想和她交往
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那鈴怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴根本不懂戀愛 看她有點驚慌失措 我就代她回絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有…這回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴…被告白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在慌什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一點都不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她那麼可…可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交上男朋友也很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個鈴 居然會有被人告白的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有必要這麼吃驚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是在打什麼壞主意?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你很閒的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點過來 有貓罐頭的半價甩賣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個很重的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是賺到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓貓們肯定也會超開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹真好用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝誇獎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣我動彈不得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說來鈴你小時候時常被誤認為男孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可現在都…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在都什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你被告白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且對方還是三年級的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話我被嚇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被嚇到了?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們總有一天會長大 就算鈴談戀愛了也很正常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來我聽說你也被人告白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介說你有些困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…也沒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交…往?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和…鈴?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 我們開始交往後一切都會很順利的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺…這也太隨意了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜歡我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹討厭我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…我喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就沒問題嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杉並同學指的肯定也是鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我們居然要交往了 感覺好唐突
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這代表我喜歡鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…不知道大家會怎麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(390,330)\1c&HC1A07D&\bord0\frz20}理樹、 你還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(250,370)\1c&HB9ACC5&\bord0\frz47\fs30}很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.51,0:12:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(370,230)\1c&HC1A07D&\bord0\frz3}其實也沒什麼事要說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還是頭一次從她那收到純粹打招呼的郵件
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們得向其他人報告一下 從恭介開始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰去說?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是身為男方的我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是提議人是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提議人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事必須由男方報告的 不然會很沒面子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴恭介…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺跟「把令嬡嫁給我吧!」似的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找我什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭…恭介
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事想告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我已經聽過了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今…今天天氣不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有嗎 感覺開始陰了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是啊 感覺會有場雨呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你交到女友了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 對方是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是鈴對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.49,0:14:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼什麼都能猜到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們終於發覺了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距離太近讓你們變得遲鈍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我一直在等這一天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期盼你們能走到一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 順利地走下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今後你們要互幫互助
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…就算我離開了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過恭介 離畢業還早吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再多照顧下我們嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說 和理樹君交往了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了啊 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道會有這一天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今後你們就在一起了 兩人 一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬 你在哭?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為鈴醬幸福 我也幸福啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是…這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢耶 可喜可賀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是所謂的有情人終成眷屬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好的 你們很般配哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你幹嘛笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是好事 當然要笑啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢 我們對此也還沒什麼實感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以希望大家別太當回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須的 我們懂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著 你們倆開始交往了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嫉…嫉妒?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道真人你也喜歡鈴…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我不就不能和理樹玩了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆真噁心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 我要和理樹一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼 莫非床位也要讓給鈴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼我一個人去住缸管啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說真人 你今後也能和理樹一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能和理樹住一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好一個青梅竹馬!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 快鬆開
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噁心死了…鬆開!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下葉留親也可以鬆口氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入Little Busters後我嘗到了各式各樣的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:18:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過今天的這種幸福感我永遠 永遠不會忘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:04.81,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你們倆為什麼不坐一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著特地坐在對角上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託別總提起這回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也還沒習慣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是說 你們接過吻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼踢我?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是越來越有女孩子氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 她是越變越野了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介 別調戲我們嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少說兩句 去追鈴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹君
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺…好害臊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…我們好歹正在交往哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那你可以不走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在和以往不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.85,0:20:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴現在…是我的女朋友!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛真厲害 讓我感覺世界煥然一新
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是叫了你的名字而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別冷不防叫我 蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話都沒說兩句就要吵架?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.71,0:20:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺話沒接上啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起碼沒有戀人那種甜蜜感
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:20:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如你這種反應
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.81,0:21:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼!!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又比如這種反應
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼!!!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列儂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 有信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時間跨度好大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下達最終任務
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在班會上毛遂自薦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最終任務…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.13,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}這世界裡存在某種秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界的秘密終於要揭曉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.41,0:22:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\pos(740,350)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}第4話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.41,0:22:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\an6\pos(818,380)\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&\fsp15}理樹和鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.28,0:23:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其羈絆將受到考驗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 最終任務
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:02.62,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとりじゃ寂しい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:08.93,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}だから手を繋いだんだっけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:19.91,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}それじゃいつまでも 子供のままだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:27.64,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}どうしても伝えたかったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:33.71,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}繋いだ手はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:40.29,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ばらばらになる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:44.08,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}ひとつずつ消えてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:50.76,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}目覚める日へ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:02:00.39,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}とっとと走っていけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:15.13,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}祭りのあとのようで 寂しいだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:02.62,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}一個人太孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:08.93,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}才會牽起彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:19.91,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}但這樣只會讓人無法成長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:27.64,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}無論如何我都要告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:33.71,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}牽起的手就要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:40.29,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}四散分離
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:44.08,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}逐一消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:50.76,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}向著夢醒之日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:02:00.39,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}大步向前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:15.13,OP2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be3}恰如曲終人散時 空剩寂寥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:18.50,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我們沒能守護住
