Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:32.78,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}時光的流逝 今日的結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:36.50,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}也理所當然地到來了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:39.96,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}一邊說著「再見」一邊目送你離去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:43.66,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}心中卻深知再也沒有「再見」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:47.00,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}人生地疏的小鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:50.75,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我們在此相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:57.88,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}不知何時 微風在身邊刮起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:03.28,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}但我並不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.94,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}我只能盡力去傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:13.50,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}每當迷茫 困惑 受傷之時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:17.61,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}雙手之間滿載的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.61,0:23:22.57,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}朝向指尖微微流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.57,0:23:27.92,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(828.266,240)}請緊緊握住那雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.01,0:22:18.50,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}なくしたもの　大切なこと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:22.09,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}守れなかった僕らの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.09,0:22:25.62,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}笑顔の影　この先いつか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:29.22,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}晴れること祈ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:32.78,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}時間は過ぎ　今日の終りは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:36.50,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}当たり前にやってくる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:39.96,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}「じゃあまたね」と見送る背中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:43.66,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}本当は「また」なんてない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:47.00,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}誰かの知らない街
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:50.75,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}僕らはそこで出会って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:57.88,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}いつからか風は　いつもそこにふいてた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:03.28,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}でも僕は君じゃないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.94,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}伝えることしか出来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:13.50,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}迷い戸惑い傷を受けたり
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:17.61,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}二つの手に乗せた记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.61,0:23:22.57,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2.667\pos(36.667,240)}指先へ幽かに残して
